WEBVTT

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:34.070
The following tale is a work of pure fiction.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:37.680
<b> June 2. 1582 - 04:00 AM{TS}</b>

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:37.680
<b> Kyoto Honno Temple {TS}</b>

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:25.950
Milord?

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.330
The stone frog cries...

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.700
My undying gratitude to ye.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.170
<b> Woeful God {ts}</b>

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:25.020
Baldy! {oi}

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:26.370
Ye slash me... {sono katana}

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.200
with <i>too</i> modest a blade! {yasui zo}

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:43.330
Baldy, be seated.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:54.850
Harbored suspicions I had, of such a demise.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:01.580
'Twas the excess of affection towards my blood, albeit, {until ga}

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:07.110
a father shan't be faulted for so.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:12.610
Known many a friend and foe in my lifetime.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:18.860
'Twas death and sacking unto foes, whilst lenience befell allies.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.170
However, Baldy... {daga na hage}

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:30.160
I intended mutuality with ye. {until datta}

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:49.280
I had intended the possession of mutuality between many more.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.040
Know ye of my mutuality?

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.200
'Tis love.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.390
'Twas the voice of Milord...

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:26.500
Nobunaga lies within the confines of Honno Temple!

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:31.010
Search the confines, and behead him upon sight! {until agero}

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:35.640
General Akechi's forces occupies the confines.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.520
Evasion his forces takes precedence, Milord. {until gozaimasu}

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.020
Securing the Triumvirate takes precedence.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:42.560
Milord...

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.260
I failed to locate their vessels.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:51.160
I've gathered few masterpieces, but I possess not an aesthete's eye. {until dou ni mo mekiki ga}

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.740
Fortunate, is the presence of my aesthetic eyes.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:00.870
Were it not for the cries of the stone frog, we may have secured them by now.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.920
The only noteworthy masterpiece secured be the Tsukumonasu tea jar.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:09.690
Little time remains. {yamoenu}

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.090
Readied the gunpowder?

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.300
Aye, Milord. {nukari wa arimasenu}

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:23.480
The blasts to follow shall incinerate the remains of Oda Nobunaga.

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:33.980
An assault?! {soutan dono}

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.610
Ambushed by a large force, aye!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:39.000
Salvaged the Thousand Character Classic scroll of Master Kuukai, I have!

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:41.870
As have I with a Muqi-esque painting!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:43.910
What of the Narashiba tea jar?!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.380
Always do I bear it unto my being!

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:49.650
I've ignited the trail of gunpowder!

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:51.210
Make haste!

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:22.540
Milord forbids the executions of the fleeing populace!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.170
Fire upon opposing warriors, and locate Nobunaga! {until nomizo}

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:32.780
I shan't weep! {nakenu}

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:43.740
Should I weep, the chill of tears shall soothe the anguish... {until ieyou mono wo}

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.220
of the gapping hole which exists now{ore no kokoro no naka ni wa}

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.320
in the core of my very being.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:00.160
State your business beyond at this hour.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:04.240
I shan't allow ye passage without the word of Milord.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.540
Open the gates.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:12.940
I desire not merely to behold the masterpieces... {until de wa nai}

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:18.470
but to determine that which causes anxiety. {until ga suru}

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:22.080
In the 24 years of service to Milord, {until nijuuyo nen}

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.930
ne'er have I felt such anxiety. {until hajimete da}

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:32.190
Be well in health upon my arrival, Milord!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.550
We have yet to locate Nobunaga!

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:40.720
Flames spread into the halls of the temple, exacerbating the search! {until gozaimasuru}

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:45.460
Locate, and return with his head!

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:46.700
Aye!

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:04.970
And thus, ushers the demise of war.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:11.960
A sole flower shall suffice in the era to come.

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:17.270
Withdraw our men from the temple!

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:19.440
Give aid to the wounded.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.210
Aye!

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:25.860
Milord.

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:30.110
The heir of Oda Nobunaga, Oda Nobutada, has left Myokaku Temple,

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:33.250
and currently confines himself in Nijo Castle.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:37.460
Nijo Castle houses the Imperial Prince and regents of the Imperial Court.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.260
Shall we lay siege to it?

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:43.480
We cease hostilities temporarily in exchange for the Imperial Prince and his regents. {until itadaku no da}

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:46.010
Have our men withdraw from the castle grounds as...

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:51.000
Honno Temple retained so ample stores of gunpowder?!

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.530
Had Oda Nobunaga foreseen my betrayal?!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.600
The last of the regents shall leave momentarily.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:05.490
I beg of thee to adorn their cloth and escape as well!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.510
The head of a clan shan't resort to such shameful tactics!

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:14.990
Should we escape this castle, Akechi's forces guard the paths out of Kyoto!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:19.160
Milord, we remain severely disadvantaged by his numbers. {until taigun}

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:21.290
We cannot repel so large a force!

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:28.640
Milord, at this junction, only an honorable death remains.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.970
Should ye deny satisfaction of death to mere footmen,

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:36.010
honor shall be retained, and we shall cremate your remains. {until mashouzo}

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:42.300
I shall join ye in death.

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.910
Prepared, Milord?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:58.990
Only duty, fame, and life exist of a warrior. {until onore}

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:05.430
Had I the leisure to prefer one... {hakari ni kakereba yahari omoki wa}

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.280
I choose life! {onore da}

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:27.530
Halt!

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:32.850
Imperial regents and wives have vacated these confines. {until natteoru}

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:34.660
Identify yourselves!

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:42.420
Treasures in the keep... {until meibutsu ni}

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:45.880
Were Death to befall Milord, {until nakiyou}

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.930
we were to conceal treasures in the well, therein-!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:52.910
Masterpieces be hidden in the well!

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:55.280
Gather the treasures and present them before Milord!

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:56.340
Aye!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:04.820
The Hatsuhana tea jar is too great a masterpiece to bear.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:14.660
Men guard the gates into Kyoto...

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:20.960
Be they men of General Akechi?!

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:26.160
Should my suspicions be true, I must find another path to Honno Temple.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.300
Why does General Akechi occupy the city?

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:49.310
Recall the celebratory banquet, when he displayed not the Octagonal tea pot.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:55.020
Neither am I of his kin.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:58.410
Fret not, Governor.

00:14:58.950 --> 00:15:03.420
Though not of his kin, our exhausted efforts for the sake of Milord

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:05.320
shall be rewarded.

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:09.430
General...

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:13.980
'Tis rebellion! {yahari sou nano da}

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:18.280
General Akechi had been afflicted with an intent to rebel!

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:25.040
Then what of Milord... {until uesama wa}

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.100
and his masterpieces?! {until meibutsugun ga}

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:19.490
Bodies are to be in wrapped robes and taken to Amida Temple.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:26.220
There, we hold a memorial for the spirits of our benefactors and Oda's men.

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:32.870
Woe, for the remains of Lord Oda mayn't be discovered here... {until okarada wa}

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:34.970
Be him a man of Oda...? {ano okata wa}

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.580
Woeful, indeed.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:44.640
Perhaps he seeks a memento of his former lord.

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.280
Why do I search through charred rubble?

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:54.300
I must return to Ibaraki Castle and inform Brother of General Akechi's betrayal.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:17:00.010
Foremost, confirming the welfare of Milord takes precedence. {until iu no ni}

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.380
Lord Nagamasu!

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:17.590
Explain your presence here!

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.650
Why do ye adorn such garments?!

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.470
Furusa, be calm of tone.

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:28.620
Though Akechi's main force has withdrawn, his remaining men occupy Kyoto.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:37.170
Though many begrudged Brother for many a reason,

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:40.320
suspected not of Akechi to lead the vanguard. {until detekuru no wa}

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:46.620
Perhaps Brother's remains were incinerated by the blasts as well.

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:51.140
Where is Lord Nobutada?! {until sama}

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:54.170
Ye followed in his escort, aye?

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:57.550
He preferred an honorable death than to one by foes.

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:00.140
'Twas I who oversaw his death.

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:11.190
T-Then the heir to the Oda clan has perished!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:17.900
Ye failed to follow in the death of your lord! {until ikaga suru}

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:21.420
Be ye naught of a true warrior?! {until gozarimasuka}

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:26.290
Retain little honor which remains, for I shall behead ye now!

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:32.420
Dare ye claim yourself a true warrior, Furusa?

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:41.180
Perhaps a true warrior who is absent of imperfection?

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:49.010
Indeed, I am.

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:55.640
I've no knowledge of your identity, {until mekiki}

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:59.610
but the blade and appraisal imply ye an aesthete.

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:05.370
A castle may be raised with that bowl.

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:10.830
Spare me, and ye may have it.

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:16.960
General Hashiba has not a discerning eye, {until minukemaite}

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:23.510
therefore, my impeccably handmade tea scoop shall suffice for the original.

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:42.880
In title alone, is imperfection absent. {until shiteorunodesu}

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.750
Ye be men of Oda!

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:03.760
Master Yasuke!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:05.720
Wear this robe.

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:11.000
Your dress be attractive to foes. {until au}

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:13.220
Your welfare settles my anxiety.

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:16.560
Akechi spared all, but warriors.

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.010
What of my brother? {aniue wa}

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.240
Ye escorted him, aye?! {soba ni itandarou}

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:22.540
The flames had obstructed my search.

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:26.940
Though an intruder fled his room with these.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.750
Have them.

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:35.210
These are...! {kore wa}

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:20.250
Masterpieces...

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:23.800
I want no part in the affairs of this nation.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:27.950
Though, I am indebted to Nobu. {until seiwa ni natta}

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:31.320
Now, in debt no longer. {until kaesu}

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:38.190
'Twould be of currish nature to procure <i>all</i> of these.

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:45.250
However...

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:55.330
perhaps a single article shall serve as memento to Milord. {until hitotsu dake}

00:21:57.950 --> 00:21:59.250
Make haste. {isoge}

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:02.350
More of Akechi's men shall come.

00:22:04.810 --> 00:22:10.090
I wish to behold the contents of each vessel... {until hako wo ake}

00:22:10.730 --> 00:22:16.100
I desire to touch and consume the texture of each masterpiece. {until jikkuri to}

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:18.500
Woe, for such leisure is absent. {until nado nai}

00:22:19.990 --> 00:22:22.730
Therefore... {until michibiku no wa}

00:22:27.430 --> 00:22:31.680
I shall have the apothecary's vessel of the left.

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:41.870
I shall have any, save for a member of the Triumvirate.

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:46.050
Deliver the rest unto the Oda clan.

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:58.190
Size and virtue are of different schools.

00:24:35.510 --> 00:24:37.160
<b> A fine woman, Furusa. {ts}</b>

00:24:47.190 --> 00:24:48.920
<b> No other need know of this.{ts}</b>

00:24:50.460 --> 00:24:52.670
Mixed Messages.

00:24:53.370 --> 00:24:58.390
Does the fork joining the aesthete and warrior exist?

00:24:56.590 --> 00:24:59.920
<b> Mixed Messages{ts}</b>
